Subject: [PATCH] Keep zone editing actions visible and use one edge-to-edge canvas

Expose Save and Close independently of the hidden panel indicator. Close and
Escape discard the edit; Save and Ctrl+S persist through the existing state API.
Remove window-preview fill and window gaps from editor geometry only.

